    "text": "\"The 19-year-old tractor-trailer driver was not hurt in the accident.\"\nYou don't find many 19 year-olds with enough experience to be driving a rig. I'd have thought that as the obvious cream of the crop of 19 year-olds, theymight know better than to try making a U-turn on a highway.\nOr was that little gem of information taught during the 5 minutes of their \"Super-Advanced Driver's Ed. - Big-Rigs & UFOs\" class, that they missed due to being in the washroom?\n(apparently the life lesson to be learned from all of this, is that sometimes you should just pee your pants...)",
